msgid "For test environments and trying things out. “Redirect messages”: every message from a workflow goes to the first recipient of the notice email (otherwise to the site’s address), with “[Test]” in the subject. “Do not execute anything”: workflows run, but no step takes effect; each step is only logged as skipped. The constant WORKFLOW_CAPTAIN_TEST_MODE in wp-config.php takes precedence."
